{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109510/extras/9b7614adb0eb51d747286038ef294888.avif?t=1761125359\" width=375 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land fallen into ruin, three pilgrims set out to meet Cetris, the Great Wyvern - who grants wishes to those worthy... Will you breathe life back into this decaying world, or perish like so many before you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realm of the Wyvern is a tactical RPG set in a richly detailed dark fantasy world. Explore the wildlands of once-great Skyllia and lead your knight, ranger, and mage to victory on a 9x9 board against countless unique foes. Find creative solutions in a turn-based combat system that's easy to grasp yet deceptively deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109510/extras/ad14c5449d8c029303ae01d756464ae1.avif?t=1761125359\" width=375 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC COMBAT:\u00a0</strong>Loot powerful artifacts and exploit a variety of mystical spells. Summon allies to fight for you, or use the power of telepathy to possess your enemies. Manage your three adventurers: knowing each one's strengths will be critical to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DETAILED, HANDCRAFTED WORLD:\u00a0</strong>Explore a compact but open world strewn with remote villages and the vestiges of ancient civilizations. Uncover millennia of arcana and piece together the rich worldbuilding of Skyllia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYER FREEDOM:\u00a0</strong>A story that's as elaborate as you want it to be: dive head-first into Skyllia's dungeons, or delve deep into dialogue with its denizens. No plodding cutscenes or filler quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-BIT VISUALS:</strong>\u00a0A unique and atmospheric retro art style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109510?t=1761125359","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109510/a97b8d9dbe414e5acd979371465a5a49425bd809/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761125359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109510/8ff78e98f655e90ff971954ad5d68c778889c23c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761125359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109510/8ff78e98f655e90ff971954ad5d68c778889c23c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761125359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109510/extras/9b7614adb0eb51d747286038ef294888.avif?t=1761125359\" width=375 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land fallen into ruin, three pilgrims set out to meet Cetris, the Great Wyvern - who grants wishes to those worthy... Will you breathe life back into this decaying world, or perish like so many before you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realm of the Wyvern is a tactical RPG set in a richly detailed dark fantasy world. Explore the wildlands of once-great Skyllia and lead your knight, ranger, and mage to victory on a 9x9 board against countless unique foes. Find creative solutions in a turn-based combat system that's easy to grasp yet deceptively deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109510/extras/ad14c5449d8c029303ae01d756464ae1.avif?t=1761125359\" width=375 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC COMBAT:\u00a0</strong>Loot powerful artifacts and exploit a variety of mystical spells. Summon allies to fight for you, or use the power of telepathy to possess your enemies. Manage your three adventurers: knowing each one's strengths will be critical to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DETAILED, HANDCRAFTED WORLD:\u00a0</strong>Explore a compact but open world strewn with remote villages and the vestiges of ancient civilizations. Uncover millennia of arcana and piece together the rich worldbuilding of Skyllia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYER FREEDOM:\u00a0</strong>A story that's as elaborate as you want it to be: dive head-first into Skyllia's dungeons, or delve deep into dialogue with its denizens. No plodding cutscenes or filler quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-BIT VISUALS:</strong>\u00a0A unique and atmospheric retro art style.</p>","developers":["solarnomad"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109510/6b8c54a616776b7a661956a4c7c37f5736a21010/header.jpg?t=1761125359","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04, Fedora 41<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109510/1219018142/dccd563c6db69d53e7cb97892c2e394f567982fe/1760614477/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761125357","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstati